> Problem: [172. 阶乘后的零](https://leetcode.cn/problems/factorial-trailing-zeroes/description/)

[TOC]

# 思路

贪心思路，数 n 以内 包含的 5 的个数。

# Code

时间0ms击败 100.00%；内存6.03MB击败 28.21%

* []

```C
int trailingZeroes(int n) {
    int ans = 0;
    while (n) 
        ans += n /= 5;
    return ans;
}
```

* []

```Python
class Solution:
    def trailingZeroes(self, n: int) -> int:
        ans = 0
        while n:
            n //= 5
            ans += n
        return ans
```

